<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>CSUCampusCraft 用户端</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css;CSUCAMPUSCRAFT_USER_SESSION=[REDACTED]">
    <script defer src="/js/app.js;CSUCAMPUSCRAFT_USER_SESSION=[REDACTED]"></script>
</head>
<body data-csucampuscraft-app="user">
<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">跳到主要内容</a>
<header class="site-header">
    <div class="container site-header-inner">
        <a class="site-brand" href="/;CSUCAMPUSCRAFT_USER_SESSION=[REDACTED]" aria-label="CSUCampusCraft 首页">
            <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">CSU</span>
            <span>CSUCampusCraft 用户端</span>
        </a>
        <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="站点导航">
            <a href="/;CSUCAMPUSCRAFT_USER_SESSION=[REDACTED]">首页</a>
            <span class="app-label">用户端</span>
            <span class="nav-placeholder" aria-label="购物车，0 件">
                购物车 <span id="cart-quantity" class="quantity-badge"
                           data-cart-quantity="0">0</span>
            </span>
        </nav>
    </div>
</header>
<div class="container global-alerts" aria-label="全局提示区">
    
    
    

</div>
<main id="main-content" class="container main-content" tabindex="-1">
    <div>
    <header class="page-heading">
        <small class="eyebrow">校园文创商城 · 工程初始化</small>
        <h1>CSUCampusCraft 用户端</h1>
        <p class="muted">面向购买者的校园文创商城。当前展示共享商品分类中的一级主题。</p>
    </header>
    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="themes-heading">
        <h2 id="themes-heading">校园主题</h2>
        <p class="muted" data-theme-count="0">
            共 <span>0</span> 个一级主题
        </p>
        <p class="empty-state">暂无主题。请确认演示数据已导入。</p>
        
    </section>
</div>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
        <span>CSUCampusCraft 校园文创商城</span>
        <span class="muted">课程实验 · 教学模拟</span>
    </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
